<title>USA: Vallejo CUSD, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</title>
<headline>Vallejo CUSD, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica said it won $20 million of Vallejo CUSD, Calif., general obligation bonds, Election of 1997, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.38 percent.</p>
</text>
